# -*- mode:org; coding:utf-8 -*-
#+TITLE: deferred-dialect-matrix-population -- what dialect-platform-version-axis left open-ended
#+STATUS: DEFERRED
#+PRIORITY: P3
#+TYPE: feature
#+DEPENDS: dialect-platform-version-axis
#+BRANCH: -
#+DATE: 2026-10-25

dialect-platform-version-axis (closed, clautolisp 2.3.62) built the product /
platform / version facets, the feature matrix and the version-gated
operators, and implemented every documented or measured difference it
listed. Left, by nature open-ended:

1. Populate *AUTOLISP-FEATURE-MATRIX* as new differences are documented or
   measured -- each behind the version facet, with a probe (pjb 2026-10-03:
   "implement them in different dialect versions, even if we can't test them
   (yet)").
2. Optionally extend the "/..." subfolder-recursion rule (and the deferred
   platform-dependent ".." BACK-vs-UP) from FINDFILE to OPEN / LOAD, and
   verify on the native runners.
3. Real printing: AutoCAD before 2022 and BricsCAD before V25 are unmeasured;
   they print as the measured versions until a probe says otherwise.
